"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Vance is temporarily taking over as White House press secretary after Karoline Leavitt left the position at the end of August.\",            \"english_title\": \"Vance Takes Over\",            \"translated_version\": \"Vance es ahora el secretario de prensa de la Casa Blanca porque Karoline Leavitt dej\u00f3 el puesto a finales de agosto.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Vance Toma el Puesto\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Clancy's lawyer claims that a juror is not following the judge's instructions about what reasonable doubt means.\",            \"english_title\": \"Juror Issue\",            \"translated_version\": \"El abogado de Clancy dice que un jurado no sigue las instrucciones del juez sobre qu\u00e9 significa duda razonable.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Problema con Jurado\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Al-Mughayyir's council says they were trying to prevent settlers from stealing sheep, but the Israeli military claims they threw stones at its troops.\",            \"english_title\": \"Conflict Over Sheep\",            \"translated_version\": \"El consejo de Al-Mughayyir dice que intentaban evitar que los colonos robaran ovejas, pero el ej\u00e9rcito israel\u00ed dice que les lanzaron piedras.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Conflicto por Ovejas\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The World Meteorological Organization has warned that the natural weather phenomenon could disrupt global economies.\",            \"english_title\": \"Weather Warning\",            \"translated_version\": \"La Organizaci\u00f3n Meteorol\u00f3gica Mundial ha advertido que el fen\u00f3meno del clima podr\u00eda afectar las econom\u00edas del mundo.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Advertencia del Clima\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Millions of people have been exposed to smog, with over 12,000 children experiencing breathing problems.\",            \"english_title\": \"Smog Affects Millions\",            \"translated_version\": \"Millones de personas han estado expuestas al smog, y m\u00e1s de 12,000 ni\u00f1os tienen problemas para respirar.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Smog Afecta a Millones\"        }    ]}"